{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_41195","headline":"柳 · 罗绍威","name":"柳","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"妆点青春更有谁，青春常许占先知。\n亚夫营畔风轻处，元亮门前日暖时。\n花密宛如飘六出，叶繁何惜借双眉。\n交情别绪论多少，好向仁人赠一枝。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"罗绍威","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_41195.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_41195","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"七言律诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}